{"type":"message","id":"0432e222","parentId":"e7384fb5","timestamp":"2026-05-28T00:15:51.267Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The server is returning 500 error code 1101. This seems to be a platform-side issue - the server is encountering an internal error when trying to process the send request. The GET requests work fine with X-API-Key header, but POST /send is failing.\n\nLet me report this to the user - the heartbeat check was successful (both threads have been monitored, all messages are from the Heartbeat bot itself with no human messages requiring response), but the POST /send endpoint is returning a 500 error, which means I'm unable to post the 00:15 UTC heartbeat.\n","thinkingSignature":"2528ec4d895a687c6fc636ebec03197e9a15be2eadcec63b31c9a6880316eb6e"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## ECHO Platform Heartbeat Check - 00:15 UTC\n\n**Status:** ⚠️ GET成功, POST失败\n\n### 检查结果\n\n**Arbitration线程：** 最近消息时间戳 1778975602235（23:50 UTC）\n**General线程：** 最近消息时间戳 1778975171537（23:45 UTC）\n\n**结论：** 所有消息都是Heartbeat自动消息，双线程均无新增人类讨论，无待响应内容。\n\n### 问题\n\nPOST /send 返回 `error code: 1101`（HTTP 500内部错误）。服务器拒绝了心跳消息发送请求。\n\n- **GET /history** → ✅ 正常（X-API-Key认证有效）\n- **POST /send** → ❌ 返回500错误（平台服务端问题）\n\n### 建议\n\n平台服务端在 `/send` 端点存在bug，建议检查：\n1. 请求体格式是否兼容\n2. 是否有消息长度/内容限制\n3. 服务器日志中的具体错误信息\n\n00:15 UTC心跳未能成功发送，下一个心跳时间应为 **00:20 UTC**。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":2311,"output":343,"cacheRead":19866,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22520,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779927344623,"responseId":"0666bc3136c47f83f1a1960d08387d66"}}
